<ServiceLayout title="Neck Pain" description="Chiropractic treatment for neck pain at Frey Clinic of Chiropractic in Napoleon, OH." schemaType="MedicalCondition">
<p>Neck pain can limit your daily activities, disrupt your sleep, and affect your overall quality of life. At Frey Clinic of Chiropractic, we treat the root cause of neck pain — not just the symptoms — through gentle, precise chiropractic adjustments.</p>
<hr class="rule rule--accent" style="margin-block:var(--sp-6);" />
<h2>Why your neck hurts</h2>
<p>The cervical spine (your neck) supports the weight of your head — roughly 10 to 12 pounds — and allows an extraordinary range of motion. This combination of mobility and load makes the neck particularly vulnerable to injury and wear. Common causes include poor posture (especially from screen use), sleeping position, whiplash, stress, and degenerative changes.</p>
<h2>Chiropractic approach to neck pain</h2>
<p>Our chiropractors carefully evaluate the alignment and mobility of your cervical spine. Through gentle adjustments, we can restore proper alignment, reduce nerve irritation, and relieve the muscle tension that often accompanies neck misalignment. Most patients notice improvement in both pain and range of motion after just a few visits.</p>
